            'label': 'Causal Multi-Horizon EWMA Velocity & Acceleration Kernel',
            'formula': 'K(x) = tanh((ewm_fast(x) - ewm_slow(x) + α·Δewm_fast(x)) / (σ_ewm + ε))',
